'''Chroma Sunset''' is a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] knife that you have a 2% chance of receiving after purchasing the 25th tier in the Battle Pass for 90,000 [[Beach Balls (Currency)|Beach Balls]] {{Currency|Beach Ball}} In the previous [[Summer Event 2025|2025 Summer Event]].

== Appearance ==
Chroma Sunset has a similar appearance to [[Sunset (Knife)|Sunset]], but it shifts colors constantly. it is replaced with various fading colors all over the godly, with the big [[FX Weapons|FX]] neon sun in the middle brightly changing color's as well.

== Trivia ==
*It is the chroma counterpart of the godly knife under the name [[Sunset (Knife)|Sunset]], which was found in the same box.
*It pairs with the godly gun [[Chroma Sunrise]] to make the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Chroma Sun Set|Chroma Sun Set]].
*As of the [[Summer Event 2025|2025 Summer Event]] this along with Sunset, [[Sunrise]], [[Chroma Sunrise]], [[Evergreen]], [[Evergun]], [[Chroma Evergreen]] and [[Chroma Evergun]] received the [[FX Weapons|FX]] tag.
*Chroma Sunset, Chroma Sunrise, Chroma fang and Chroma luger are the only [[Chroma Weapons]] that are completely covered in rainbow color in the player's inventory.
*This is the 1st chroma that could be obtained in a battlepass.

